"...Well then, I'd like to wrap things up for today.
Thank you all very much."
When I said my goodbyes, everyone nodded one after another.{p}

"Well, goodbye, everyone.
I'll walk Fukuzawa home."
Hosoda stood up.{p}

"Um..."
"Hm, what is it?"
"Was your story true, Kazama?"{p}

Kazama was running toward me at an incredible speed.
Wasn't his stomach supposed to hurt?
What on earth is with this guy...★{p}

"I think I'll head home for today.
I'll come by to visit again sometime."
A meaningful little smile.{p}
